SUMMARY:Wag & Wine Wednesday at grandview
DESCRIPTION:Bring your furry pet and enjoy an afternoon or evening on the deck\, sipping on wine and relaxing in the sunshine from 2pm – 7pm! Dog wine and biscuits available for purchase. We’ll be highlighting an adorable pet each week on our social media!No reservations necessary. Outside deck seating only for pets. Seating will be limited to every other table to allow adequate spacing of pets. Dogs must be leashed at all times. Please no retractable leashes. Please clean up after your pets.Each pet owner assumes responsibility for his/her dog and assumes all liability for damage or injury that may occur due to his/her pet
