SUMMARY:Thursday YOGA
DESCRIPTION:It’s finally time to wrap up our Yoga in the Vineyard. Join us @ Grandview for the end of summer 2026 series. $20 includes 1 hour vinyasa practice and your first beverage of choice. Stay after to enjoy social time with friends! Register on Eventbrite or contact for Venmo option.\nhttps://venmo.com/u/Deborah-Slider\n\nClick Here to Purchase Tickets
