SUMMARY:Trucker Hat Burning Workshop at grandview
DESCRIPTION:Create a custom hat that’s as unique as you are! \nOnly 15 Space are available\, so reserve your seat today! \nClick Here to Purchase Tickets \nJoin us for a fun\, hands-on Suede Trucker Hat Design Workshop\, where you’ll personalize a stylish suede trucker hat using professional pyrography (woodburning) tools. Add custom patterns\, western-inspired designs\, florals\, initials\, names\, meaningful symbols\, or freehand artwork to create a hat you’ll love to wear. \nNo experience? No problem! We’ll guide you through the entire process\, from planning your design to learning safe decorating techniques. Stencils\, inspiration\, and one-on-one instruction will be available to help you bring your ideas to life. \nChoose your favorite hat color when you arrive! A variety of suede trucker hat colors will be available on a first-come\, first-served basis. \nWorkshop Details: \nCost: $45 per person / Ages: 15 through Adult \nYour Registration Includes: \n• One suede trucker hat \n• All tools and supplies \n• Step-by-step instruction \n• Access to design templates and creative inspiration \nA variety of hat chains will be available for purchase. \nClick Here to Purchase Tickets
URL:https://grandviewwines.com/vineyard-event/trucker-hat-burning-workshop-at-grandview/
LOCATION:Grandview Vineyard\, 1489 Grandview Rd\, Mount Joy\, PA\, 17552\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://grandviewwines.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/ChatGPT-Image-Sep-1-2026-10_48_32-PM.png
END:VEVENT
