SUMMARY:Pumpkin Succulent Planter Workshop at grandview
DESCRIPTION:🌿 Pumpkin Succulent Planter Workshop 🎃 \nJoin us for a hands-on workshop where you’ll create a beautiful\, long-lasting pumpkin succulent planter—a perfect centerpiece to brighten your space for months! \nWhat’s Included:  \n✨ A real 6–7 lb. “Ghost” pumpkin\n🌱 A variety of healthy succulents\n🌾 Preserved moss and a mini bundle of dried florals\n🪴 Soil and planting materials\n📘 Step-by-step guided instruction from our experienced team \nWe’ll teach you best practices for succulent care and maintenance—including soil and sunlight needs\, watering\, and propagation—so your plants thrive even after the season ends. \n💡 No carving or glue involved! That means your pumpkin stays fresh longer\, and your succulents remain unharmed and easily transplantable when you’re ready to move them into a permanent home. \n🌟 Bonus: After you finish your pumpkin planter\, we’ll also show you how to transfer your succulents into a long-term container so you can enjoy them for years to come! \nFood and Drink: \nGrandview offers light bites\, small snacks\, and a selection of alcoholic and non-alcoholic beverages such as wine\, beer\, specialty cocktails and wine slushies\, available for purchase. Attendees are also welcome to bring their own food. \nPlease Note: \n\n\nTickets are non-refundable and non-transferable. If you’re unable to attend\, please email us at events@terrariumtherapyworkshops.com to discuss your options. \n\n\nPre-registration and pre-payment are required to reserve your seat. \n\n\nPlant varieties are subject to change based on availability to ensure the highest quality for your project. \nClick Here to Purchase Tickets
URL:https://grandviewwines.com/vineyard-event/pumpkin-succulent-planter-workshop-at-grandview/
LOCATION:Grandview Vineyard\, 1489 Grandview Rd\, Mount Joy\, PA\, 17552\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://grandviewwines.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/924-Grandview-Pumpkin-Wix.png
END:VEVENT
